# UI reference screenshots dropped at the repo root. Inspiration only — these
# are other companies' apps and must never be committed or shipped as assets.
#
# The rule was here and the patterns only covered one naming convention, so
# Fintech1-5.png sat in version control regardless. Matching any loose image at
# the ROOT is the version of this that cannot be sidestepped by naming a file
# something else — app assets live in app/assets/ and are unaffected.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp

# A 2026-02 snapshot of ~24 screen files, committed as an archive. Every one of
# them exists in app/ in a newer form, under the SAME filename — which is the
# problem: a search for accounts.tsx or settings.tsx turns up two versions and
# nothing says which is live.
/*.zip
